Package: vicgtfstools
Type: Package
Title: Open and Process Victorian GTFS Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Adam", "Bain",
      email = "adambain014@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Tools for downloading, opening, and processing General Transit Feed 
    Specification (GTFS) data from Public Transport Victoria (PTV). Provides 
    functions to download the latest Victorian GTFS schedule, open individual 
    transport mode feeds, and combine multiple feeds with mode metadata.
